flowchart TD
    Start([Admin / Super Admin Clicks Avatar / Edit Profile]) --> OpenModal[Open MyProfileModal<br/>src/features/admin/components/MyProfileModal.tsx]
    
    OpenModal --> LoadProfile[Load Current Profile & Contact Links<br/>fetchMyContactLinks in profileService.ts]
    LoadProfile --> RenderForm[Render Form Fields:<br/>Display Name, Support Phone, Support Email, Job Title,<br/>Show on Lockout Toggle, Social Contact Links, Avatar]
    
    RenderForm --> UserEdit[User Modifies Fields / Uploads Avatar / Adds Links]
    
    UserEdit --> AvatarUpload{Avatar Image Changed?}
    AvatarUpload -- Yes --> BucketUpload[Upload to Supabase Storage 'avatars'<br/>Path: userId/avatar.ext<br/>Enforce MIME type & 2MB max size]
    AvatarUpload -- No --> ValidateFields
    BucketUpload --> ValidateFields[Validate Form & Link URLs]
    
    ValidateFields --> URLCheck{Are URLs Valid HTTPS / tel: / mailto:?}
    URLCheck -- Invalid Scheme (javascript:/data:) --> ShowValidationError[Display Protocol Validation Error]
    ShowValidationError --> RenderForm
    
    URLCheck -- Valid --> SaveRPC[Call update_my_profile RPC<br/>Self-only: auth.uid = profiles.id<br/>Role & privilege fields NOT modifiable]
    
    SaveRPC --> LinkSync[Upsert Rows in profile_contact_links<br/>Filter: profile_id = auth.uid]
    
    LinkSync --> SaveDB[(Update public.profiles & public.profile_contact_links<br/>RLS enforced)]
    
    SaveDB --> RealtimeInvalidate[Invalidate Query Cache in TanStack Query<br/>Query Key: ['public_support_contacts']<br/>Supabase Realtime Channel Notification]
    
    RealtimeInvalidate --> ToastSuccess[Show 'Profile updated successfully']
    
    %% Consumer: Public Login Screen
    RealtimeInvalidate -. Broadcast / Query Invalidation .-> LoginConsumer[Login Screen Lockout Card<br/>src/features/auth/components/LoginForm.tsx]
    LoginConsumer --> CallPublicRPC[Call get_public_support_contacts RPC<br/>Returns ONLY display_name, phone, email, and public links<br/>No private profile or role details exposed]
    CallPublicRPC --> RenderSupportCard([Locked User Sees Updated Support Channels & Links])
